WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.670
The landscape suggested emptiness.

2
00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:05.270
The portraits suggested timelessness.

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.890
The settler scenes suggested destiny.

4
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.660
Curtis crystallizes all of it
into disappearance

5
00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.850
and sells the idea in twenty volumes.

6
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.970
Historians now give the whole tradition a name:
the Myth of the Vanishing Indian.
